/*
 * Implements recursive-inheritance detection for class declarations.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - walking the ancestor chain of a class,
 *   - detecting direct or indirect inheritance cycles,
 *   - reporting RECURSIVE_ANCESTOR errors.
 *
 * This verification step is invoked during class-ancestor validation and
 * ensures that class hierarchies remain acyclic.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
